# Linux Leptocline — Kali-exclusive tools, from the Kali repo (pinned low).
# All 32 were verified to install AND co-install on the Debian trixie base
# (apt resolution simulation) before shipping. Tools that need Kali's newer
# Python 3.14 / Ruby (metasploit, netexec, evil-winrm, theharvester, sslyze,
# set, commix, crackmapexec, bloodyad) are NOT installable on trixie and are
# left out — Metasploit is available at runtime via `lepto msf`.
# Authorised testing only.

